EXPERIMENT 6
Implementation of Dimensionality
Reduction Techniques (PCA, SVD and
LDA)
Aim
To study and implement dimensionality reduction techniques such as Principal Component
Analysis (PCA), Singular Value Decomposition (SVD), and Linear Discriminant Analysis
(LDA) using Python.
Lab Objectives
